  width    64: verify   512 cells in   0.027 ms -> True
  width  1024: verify  8192 cells in   0.400 ms -> True
PASS  VERIFICATION is linear in the number of cells   | the easy direction, measured
  width 2:    128 horizontally-consistent rows
  width 3:   1024 horizontally-consistent rows
  width 4:   8192 horizontally-consistent rows
  width 5:  65536 horizontally-consistent rows
PASS  while the SEARCH space of rows grows exponentially with width   | and the problem's width is 2^N — completeness is cited (Schwarzentruber 2019), not re-proved
```

